{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"The City (Manhattan)","id":"850786156479119391","name":"central-park🏞","position":52,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“The only way I can describe it is their combined power being opposites was killing me. I’m a mortal containing the powers of beings of immeasurable power.” She sighs. “Call it what you want, but I don’t even think death would answer the questions I have. But living is for damn sure.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:21:41.585000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878252451524919316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Then use that. Fight to live. Fight for another minute with yourself. Never be a victim of circumstance, or even higher powers. Things do not *just happen*, okay? We let them happen.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:22:38.404000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878252689841094666","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"You get to be the one to decide when Athena comes out to play. You are her hand on this material plane. Not anyone's puppet.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:22:59.015000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T12:28:12.317000Z","id":"878252776289861633","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“Athena understands that as much as I do. Zariel is the one you should point that at.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:24:19.154000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878253112417189918","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Then it's the same thing. Fuck if Zariel's more — Zariel? Okay, never mind, point going on — fuck if she's more powerful in the nine hells. She needs you here, doesn't she? Find it in yourself to tell her to fuck off.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:25:26.611000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T12:25:49.708000Z","id":"878253395352375297","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'I don't know who Zariel is, but she's not you. You're you.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:26:09.592000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878253575627739206","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“It’s not that simple. It’s not like telling someone that can’t just wonder on into your head because you have a connection just to say ‘Hey, I can help you save everyone.’ This is something that can take me if I want it or not if she wants me. The only thing stopping her is Athena, hence why I want to keep the option open to her. If it means keeping me safe, I will gladly let Athena in.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:29:15.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878254354493210625","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Maybe she can take you because you're letting her. You believe so strongly that she just can. If she gets in, then she gets in, but gods forbid you don't board the door when you know the devil comes knocking.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:32:12.551000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878255097988120597","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"She rolls her eyes. “It’s something I have to live with. It’s something you will never know, and I honestly hope you don’t. It’s the worst feeling I can imagine.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:34:17.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878255620137054248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I just know I didn't live this long by being defeatist. Yes, I don't understand the powers at play here, but I believe you have your own power in this and I can see you don't agree.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:37:58.122000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878256547417956362","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'I don't know much about gods, about devils, or anything in between. But... aren't a lot of them based on faith and belief?'","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:38:17.951000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878256630586806332","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"(~~wow I'm an awful priestess~~)","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:39:28.019000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878256924473307178","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“There’s a belief that beings of power are fed by worship. Nobody has really proven that to my knowledge, but it’s possible.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:39:54.795000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878257036779991091","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Roy shrugs. \"In swarm villages back home you won't find that many people being religious. We mostly follow and respect nature and its life, not any higher being behind them. So gods haven't really been bothering us, just as much as we haven't been bothering them. But with the wars, things are more and more of a mess. So who knows?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:41:47.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878257511541665852","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"The Old Gods are at war, too. I'm actually surprised Athena's not fighting it. But well, it's how she's operating so I wan't ask too many questions.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:43:12.835000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T12:43:42.490000Z","id":"878257867419942953","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“Maybe she is. War is one of her major points.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:44:29.378000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878258188464570378","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Maybe that's why she didn't intervene when the archdevil possessed you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:44:35.014000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878258212103671828","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“I’m not sure. I.. I think she might have been trying to help me resist. But… the rage….” She paused. “For an instant, it felt… good.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:46:10.713000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878258613494362183","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"she nods. 'I can understand that. It doesn't make you a bad person.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:46:49.623000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878258776694751262","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'I got feelings like that a lot when I was in a pact with the ***Thing***.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:47:06.107000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878258845833658418","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'I wanted to capture and torture redcoats, cut out their tongues, in retaliation for being the indirect cause of me losing my laugh to the fae.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:48:19.345000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878259153016086588","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“I know I brushed that rage before, but it never felt like it was truly right. This, however, did.” She pauses. “I might rest like you guys said.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:50:50.983000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878259789031944193","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'That might be best. Get some sleep, get something to eat, and if you want to talk, you know where I am.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:51:20.859000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878259914340986931","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"She stands there for a moment. “If i start acting off, feel free to punch me in the face.” She then smiles and sighs. “Anything you guys need from me before I retire for the ni-“ She looks up. “Early morning?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:53:33.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878260469926858792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
