{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Willow rushes forward to wards Eliot, but instead of calling his name or hugging him right off she runs up and smacks him before hugging him. \"You jerk! What happened to you?!\"\n\nEliot, shaken free from his daze looks at the red panda confused. \"W-Willow? Why are you here?\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:03:04.112000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878595052874653696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"You've been gone all day. Had me worried sick! And now.... look at you...\"  She clings tightly to him as she cries.","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:05:22.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878595631663419473","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Eliot returns the hug. \"I'm sorry..\" looking up Eliot notices Demetrius. \"Mister Demetrius? You're here too?\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:13:40.069000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878597720271650846","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"He nods. \"I came looking for you at the cafe and found Willow there, distraught.\" He kneels down and takes a look at Eliot. \"You seem to be in quite a state. Are you able to walk?\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:17:23.477000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878598657312698430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Um.. yes. I think so.... Did... Did you need something?\" Eliot asks hesitantly, worried he's already insulted the ancient fey.","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:20:39.086000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878599477756313680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Demetrius shakes his head. \"I don't need anything, but I do think you should come home. I know WIllow thinks the same.\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:26:14.380000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878600884081270804","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I... I can't go yet sir. I'm waiting for someone... something? I don't know...\" Eliot sighs softly.","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:27:42.603000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878601254115348540","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Do you mind if I ask who or what?\" he says, looking curiously.","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:28:44.252000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878601512690004018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I'm not sure... they didn't give me a name. They're also the one that did this to me... they changed shapes though, one of them was some sort of wolf hybrid? They also howled and brought out the dead...\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:31:50.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878602292583075840","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Demetrius' face turns deadly serious. \"Why do you have to wait for such a creature?\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:32:50.697000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878602546355273759","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I... I promised it food.. in exchange for my life and the people I was with... I... I think I would have died if I hadn't...\" Eliot explains, but looks away unable to meet Demetrius' gaze.","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:35:04.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878603109608325132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Demetrius sighs. \"You seem especially good at making deals with creatures you fear, young Eliot.\" He pauses for a moment. \"Did you specify the kind of food?\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:38:42.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878604021554884608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I did not... just that I'd make all the food it'd want...\" Eliot let's a few tears roll down his cheeks. \"I was in it's mouth... the word went black... I'm still not sure how I'm alive... I'm sorry Mister Demetrius...\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:43:31.667000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878605234778292225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Demetrius smiles sadly. \"Well you didn't agree to stay here and wait for it. If it cares so much on following up, it can find you at the cafe. And please don't worry about safety of the others, the cafe is under my protection. I guarantee you that.\" He offers you a hand up.","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:49:31.549000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878606744232812544","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Eliot takes the offered hand and holds onto Willow as he stands. \"I.. I don't know how to find it..  or how it will find me... I just thought it would be easier to wait here...\" Eliot explains before adding in a whisper. ||\"Either for me to cook what it wants.. or for it to finish the job...\"|| Eliot can't even look in Demetrius' general direction.","created_at":"2021-08-21T11:53:49.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878607827537629194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
