{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"The creature disguised itself as a person and joined us, before trying to separate a few of us from the rest. It caused heavy bleeding with its attacks, summoned ghosts to aid it, and eventually teleported from us to Eloise who stayed behind.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T12:18:38.601000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-24T12:22:54.871000Z","id":"879701235496783882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"While we were fighting it and its summons, Eloise tried to plead with the beast, but it apparently had a different idea for what deal was up in the air.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T12:19:29.109000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-24T12:22:58.420000Z","id":"879701447342718976","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Eloise tried to stop us from harming the beast, and offered to feed it. We managed to separate her from its grasp, but the beast shapeshifted again and fled in the dark.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T12:21:01.199000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-24T12:22:47.373000Z","id":"879701833596166154","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
